        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2b4ba7b5-ee5b-4b8e-84bd-81f5de34d531).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets are venture capitalists who are all funding a massively illegal and unethical mass surveillance network and selling it to the highest bidder. Our intel operatives have actually spent a considerable amount of effort into setting you up for success. They&apos;ve been given a free day at the hot spring. Should be easy to simply drop a taser or other electrical device while they are all bathing together. Of course, that&apos;s assuming you are able to smuggle one in. If you can&apos;t, improvise, 47.",
